  "description": "ZIJSIW crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 N28 O60 Sm8. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 9 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 9 O neighbors; Sm5 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm6 (Sm) has 9 O neighbors; Sm7 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm8 (Sm) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.831-3.895 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.48-112.75°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Sm8(sao)4(μ3-OH)4(NO3)12(DMF)12]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
